{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1000_p", "source_sha256": "93562ddf58bd139c3a6eb9cd5174ef677e9e8b3f8a995d4b6ca7f1840da6cc64", "ja": "（今日はグラビア撮影、ファッション誌の\nウェディング特集だ。翼は準備できたかな？）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄时尚杂志婚礼特辑的写真照。翼准备好了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "36da856c11809d9b253620ea524e59f935cabb65db35c564c40c3aa54b19a6cd", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nどうですか？　おかしいとことか、ありません？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n怎么样？有没有哪里显得很奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dd5e618ad276b57f3aa889b69402c48147fd05da26ccb3f8ee9bca0f70d2b9d1", "ja": "おっ！　うん、いいと思うよ。\nロケーションにも、バッチリ合ってるな。", "zh": "哦！嗯，我觉得挺好的。\n和拍摄地点也非常合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d466dc2d4cfbfeb031532ff7c5c0aab9fe7809eb5c5a18336f0534c9e517bd02", "ja": "バッチリって、どれくらいバッチリですか～？\n恋人にしたいって思うくらい？", "zh": "你说的“完美”，到底是有多完美呀～？\n是完美到想让我当恋人的程度吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1004_p", "source_sha256": "05ec90208ff4d5439a018a3b09be9b1f6f648bfecbadb6e0ae02b775732d9edd", "ja": "そこはお嫁さんじゃないのか……いや。\nそうだな、そう思うくらい、バッチリだよ。", "zh": "那里不是该说“想娶回家当老婆”吗……不对。\n没错，就是棒到让人产生那种想法的程度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2e34610bbc7c0a2b9e4bc106a90da2cad4e0095a03ff09c6dfc20b0036c22be4", "ja": "えへへ♪　それじゃあ～……。\nせっかく着替えたんだし、わたし練習したいな～。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 那么就……  \n难得都换好衣服了，我想练习一下呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c3f6da64ebcd550c6b3d48d737b8c4ab5482963a44e448da987a95ecc2c354c7", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n相手役、やってくれませんか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n能陪我对戏吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1007_p", "source_sha256": "28bfb7494c0406765f1f9d827a0ed74947a53c32a2ca0c41faa420e48c7520be", "ja": "俺が？　まあ、いいけど……どのシーンの\n練習がしたいんだ？　今日は何枚か撮るけど。", "zh": "我？嗯，倒也可以……不过你想练习哪一幕？今天还要拍好几条呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bd1ad0607628a2522b0c82591fc33fa3d9bbdbef6237b47f61ff4fd00cb90cfb", "ja": "それはもちろん、キスシーン！\n愛し合うふたりの、クライマックスじゃないですか。", "zh": "当然是吻戏啦！\n这不是相爱的两个人迎来高潮的时刻吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "db2e8d8b920094b381d18f51e7caa372bf185571bb55f6e990c9d006a6b19dfc", "ja": "{$P$}さん、わたしと、\n永遠の愛を誓いましょ～♪　んー……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，和我\n许下永恒的爱意吧～♪　嗯——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1b4119d9feb54d4a5a29f6abfff3382b85833c4855b4a082daa85847da469f37", "ja": "待て待て、そんなシーンないだろ！\nほ、ほら、そろそろ撮影が始まりそうだから……！", "zh": "等等等等，根本没有这种场景吧！\n好、好啦，拍摄差不多要开始了，所以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "844110ce7fbc99b1b4e06efbf8617a46fb01d8280bbf727bca2759cf06fcb163", "ja": "えー？　いいとこだったのに～！　残念だな～。\nじゃあ、行ってきまーす……。", "zh": "诶——？明明正精彩呢～！真可惜啊～。\n那我去拍摄啦——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1012_p", "source_sha256": "41f54355e8e3566b9a418299fdefc976c7ddec83ccddefdf34a2b5483fd76572", "ja": "（撮影は順調に進み、中休みになった。いつになく\n真剣な表情を見せる翼に、スタッフも驚いていた）", "zh": "（拍摄顺利进行着，中途迎来了休息时间。翼露出了平时难得一见的认真表情，连工作人员都感到惊讶。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1013_p", "source_sha256": "65425d797da0ce1e6bab0d3b020a01f1031290a726b8282b626cb390b9c3b106", "ja": "翼、お疲れさま！　いい感じじゃないか！\nこれなら後半も、心配なさそうだな。", "zh": "翼，辛苦了！状态不错嘛！这样看来，后半段也不用担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "223f53e9b77e11d1d9b5dbcb536d2d14ecd70e53e4af8dd429555dd322c7e2d7", "ja": "ほんとですか～！　{$P$}さんの\nこと考えながらやったからかな？　えへへ♪", "zh": "真的吗～！是因为一边想着{$P$}先生一边做，才会这样吗？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1015_p", "source_sha256": "013f644599607a5fe8d68d5895749d33a6d7d87f60b431c537bfe9159506c635", "ja": "またそんな……。\nあんまりからかわないでくれよ。", "zh": "别又这样……  \n别老逗我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d3fc72128f3db0cae58528f4aaaee8afbcc3c6629789d6e05b55625a81751a66", "ja": "む～、からかってないってば～！\n{$P$}さんこそ、すぐごまかして。", "zh": "唔～都说了不是在捉弄你啦～！明明是{$P$}先生，总是马上就糊弄过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "65bd4098e899e21c0ba385ae47dd8edf2c3a1587e17735342e9f3da9aa683b1c", "ja": "わたし、まだ子供かもですけど……ウェディング\nドレス着た時くらい、真剣なんだから！", "zh": "我也许还是个小孩子……但穿上婚纱\n的时候，我可是很认真的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8c17d2515c8e2ea38805412a7cb166213942fad672bcbbf6bb3fc9348838580c", "ja": "……。ごめん、そうだな。茶化して悪かった。\n翼が本物のお嫁さんみたいで、照れくさかったんだ。", "zh": "……抱歉，你说得对。我不该开你玩笑的。\n是因为翼看起来就像真正的新娘一样，让我觉得有些不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7ec63c55d4a46dc2493204151289496302df968209ec04ee49481b0ac04ef7d1", "ja": "撮影中だって、何度もドキッとさせられた。\n翼はすごく大人っぽくて、綺麗だと思うよ。", "zh": "拍摄过程中，你好几次都让我心头一跳。\n我觉得翼真的很有成熟韵味，也很漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8119e487289c27741d19c383cda0f32d7e9a743c6c49f7043459607472a807e8", "ja": "……。あ、あれっ？\nや、やだ、わたし……うぅ、どうしよ、顔が熱い～！", "zh": "……。咦、咦？\n讨、讨厌啦，我……唔，怎么办，脸好烫～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1022_p", "source_sha256": "cd96b895ed4bb71384f70165a1d5368200f8f1f6b8bb8f178e7ffa4be654531f", "ja": "えっ！？　だ、大丈夫か？", "zh": "诶！？没、没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "10705d9631a4aa7953d63deef32d992db02937ed9c037664e5378996e15467eb", "ja": "まだ撮影、残ってるのに……。\nわたし、こんなんじゃ写真に写れないよ～！", "zh": "明明还剩下拍摄……  \n我这个样子，没法拍照啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d1056798277fd9a63345b897f0bc7f3e0b953c91677b6de91dff02b8caee34aa", "ja": "うぅ……お、お色直ししてきま～す！", "zh": "呜呜……我、我去补个妆回来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0254_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a35550fc3fc2e34bfbbf57088a3a075bf475a00ca2b21c4e60b88fd4ab64de28", "ja": "（翼は走って行ってしまった。なんだか、\n悪い事してしまったな……頑張ってくれ！）", "zh": "（翼跑掉了。总觉得好像做了件不太好的事……加油啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
